{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/calendar\/recurrencerule\/matchingpolicy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV14RecurrenceRuleV14matchingPolicyAC08MatchingG0Ovp","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"title":"matchingPolicy","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"matchingPolicy"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Calendar","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MatchingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV14MatchingPolicyO"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS"},{"introducedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"introducedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS"},{"introducedAt":"18.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/matchingPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/calendar","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/frequency-swift.property","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/interval","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/end-swift.property","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/repeatedTimePolicy","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/setPositions"],"anchor":"Working-with-recurrence-rule-properties","title":"Working with recurrence rule properties"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"matchingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Calendar","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MatchingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials8CalendarV14MatchingPolicyO","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/MatchingPolicy"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An occurrence may not be a valid date if it falls on a leap day or a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leap hour when there is not one. When that happens, we can choose to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignore the occurrence (","type":"text"},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), choose a later time which has the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same components (","type":"text"},{"code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), or find an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"earlier time (","type":"text"},{"code":".previousTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, consider an event happening every year, starting on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"29th of February 2020. When the matching policy is set to ","type":"text"},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"it yields the following recurrences:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2020-02-29"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-02-29"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2028-02-29"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"…"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With ","type":"text"},{"code":"matchingPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"code":".previousTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"we get a result for each year:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2020-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2021-02-28"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2022-02-28","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2023-02-28"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lastly, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"matchingPolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moves invalid occurrences to the day after February 29:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2020-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2021-03-01"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2022-03-01","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2023-03-01"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-02-29","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The same logic applies for missing leap hours during daylight saving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time switches. For example, consider an event repeating daily, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"starts at March 9 2024, 01:30 PST. With a ","type":"text"},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" matching policy,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event repeats on the following dates, and skips a day:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-09 01:30 PST (09:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(on 2024-03-10, there is a missing hour between 1am and 2am)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-03-11 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-12 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"With ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"matchingPolicy"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".previousTimePreservingSmallerComponents"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"we get a result for each day:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-03-09 01:30 PST (09:30 UTC)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-10 02:30 PST (10:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(on 2024-03-10, there is a missing hour between 1am and 2am)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-03-11 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-12 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Lastly, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"matchingPolicy"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"moves invalid occurrences an hour forward:"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-03-09 01:30 PST (09:30 UTC)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2024-03-10 00:30 PST (08:30 UTC)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(on 2024-03-10, there is a missing hour between 1am and 2am)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-11 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2024-03-12 01:30 PDT (08:30 UTC)","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Default value is "},{"code":".nextTimePreservingSmallerComponents","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"What to do when a recurrence is not a valid date","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://FoundationEssentials/documentation/FoundationEssentials/Calendar/RecurrenceRule/matchingPolicy":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Calendar\/RecurrenceRule\/matchingPolicy","role":"symbol","title":"matchingPolicy","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text"